(968,71,N'8.12',N'DLP-08',N'Screenshot Photograph Training And Auditing',N'The organisation must define, implement and maintain practical controls for screenshot photograph training and auditing, proportionate to business need, information classification and security risk. The purpose is to ensure screenshot photograph training and auditing is authorized, effective, monitored and supported by evidence.',N'Ensure screenshot photograph training and auditing is authorized, effective, monitored and supported by evidence.',N'screenshot photograph training and auditing; technology security; 8.12',1,N'Merged into DLP-01 — Merged'),
