(1192,91,N'8.32',N'CHG-06',N'Deployment Implementation And Scheduling',N'The organisation must define, implement and maintain practical controls for deployment implementation and scheduling, proportionate to information classification, business need and security risk. It also covers impact dependency and security assessment. It also covers testing acceptance and quality control. It also covers post-implementation review and failure learning. The purpose is to ensure deployment implementation and scheduling is authorized, effective, monitored and supported by evidence. It also aims to ensure impact dependency and security assessment is authorized, effective, monitored and supported by evidence. It also aims to ensure testing acceptance and quality control is authorized, effective, monitored and supported by evidence. It also aims to ensure post-implementation review and failure learning is authorized, effective, monitored and supported by evidence.',N'Ensure deployment implementation and scheduling is authorized, effective, monitored and supported by evidence. Ensure impact dependency and security assessment is authorized, effective, monitored and supported by evidence; Ensure testing acceptance and quality control is authorized, effective, monitored and supported by evidence; Ensure post-implementation review and failure learning is authorized, effective, monitored and supported by evidence.',N'impact dependency and security assessment; technology security; 8.32; testing acceptance and quality control; deployment implementation and scheduling; post-implementation review and failure learning',0,N'Reviewed - all merged sources addressed'),
